  "description": "The `Sumapap.Mvvm.Maui` package provides a set of tools and abstractions for implementing the MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel) architectural pattern in your MAUI applications. It includes features such as data binding, command handling, and view model management. With Sumapap.Mvvm.Maui, you can easily structure your application using the MVVM pattern while maintaining a clean and modular architecture.",
